@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title EatingHalal — verified local demo deployment
node "Development computer" <<device>> {
  node "Chrome / modern web browser" <<executionEnvironment>> as Browser {
    artifact "React client assets" as Client
  }
  node "Java runtime" <<executionEnvironment>> as Java {
    node "Embedded Tomcat :8080" <<executionEnvironment>> as Tomcat {
      artifact "EatingHalal Spring Boot application" as Backend
      artifact "Built React assets /static" as Static
    }
  }
  node "PostgreSQL server\nlocal demo: random loopback port" <<executionEnvironment>> as PG {
    database "Persistent demo database" as Database
  }
}
node "Open Food Facts service" <<external>> as OFF
Browser -- Tomcat : HTTP loopback :8080\nHTML / JS / CSS / JSON
Java -- PG : JDBC on loopback
Java -- OFF : HTTPS :443\nonly if explicitly enabled
Static ..> Client : delivered to browser
Backend ..> Database : schema applied by Flyway
note bottom of PG
Docker Compose alternative: PostgreSQL 16 on :5432.
Verified native demo/tests: PostgreSQL 14.15.
Both use real PostgreSQL, not an in-memory replacement.
end note
note bottom of Browser
Local only: no publicly reachable deployment.
No CI/CD pipeline was executed.
end note
@enduml
